353    * day. Will use the current otap configuration in OTAP_CONFIG, where PRESERVE_DAYS defines
354    * the days to keep test results, the DELETE_BATCH_SIZE defines the amount of rows to delete
355    * before committing them and DELETE_DELAY the seconds to wait after a commit before deleting
356    * more rows. Records must be marked for deletion. Provides debug logging if debug mode is
357    * activated in OTAP_CONFIG.
358    */
359    PROCEDURE result_cleanup;
